; Independent six-junction elongated branch-with-loop topology, held out entirely from
; Cycle B training (Bundle F's "development OOD" topology). Structurally distinct from
; every training topology: has both a tank (like golden-reference) and a long branching
; spur (like branched-loop) plus a small terminal loop, at a larger physical scale
; (longer pipe runs) representing genuine distribution shift, not just a relabeling of
; an existing training network.
[TITLE]
HydroSwarm independent coastal-branch topology, held out for development OOD

